+**Record construction is not an exception.** For a plain two-outcome
+`Maybe` or `Either`, put each response builder in a named `where` helper
+and route with `maybe` or `either`. A record-building arm should not keep
+a `case` merely because it performs a field conversion. Use `either` for
+`Either`; `maybe` is the corresponding eliminator for `Maybe`.
+
+```purescript
+respond source = either failed succeeded (compile source)
+  where
+  failed diagnostic = failureResponse diagnostic
+  succeeded generated = successResponse generated
+```
